# Security Policy (TEMPLATE — not active until copied to /SECURITY.md)

> PSR-8c0 draft. Do not treat this path as the canonical security policy.

## Supported versions

| Version | Supported |
| --- | --- |
| tip / release candidates | yes |
| older tags | best-effort |

## Reporting a vulnerability

Please report security issues privately.

- Preferred: _TBD security contact email_
- Do not open public GitHub issues for undisclosed vulnerabilities
- Include: impact, reproduction steps, affected SHA/tag

## Response targets (aspirational)

- Acknowledgement: 3 business days
- Initial severity assessment: 7 business days

## Safe harbor

Good-faith research that follows this policy is appreciated. Avoid privacy
violations, service degradation, and data destruction.
